  "research_notes": "Iteration 15 explore update. Signed convention retained. Accepted core dataset-specific associations remain: MSI-high stronger WRN; SMARCA4 loss stronger SMARCA2; TP53 loss weaker USP7; KEAP1 loss weaker NFE2L2; CDKN2A loss stronger MDM2. H158 remains unresolved because independent validation crossed null, but this does not overturn broader accepted MDM2/CDKN2A evidence. Validation budget is exhausted.\n\nNewly registered comparisons are prioritized for follow-up: MDM2 broad low-9p21 refinement, MDM2 high-Cas9 robustness, WRN/USP7/NFE2L2 high-serum robustness, low-ploidy robustness for four core outcomes, MYC-amplification effects in high-MYC-expression contexts for DHX9 and RPL11, and EGFR-amplification-to-KRAS-dependency candidate in adenocarcinoma KRAS-wildtype. Avoid sparse exact MDM2 co-deletion splits and prioritize populated strata. Any conclusions remain associations in the supplied panel, not causal or external-generalizability claims."
}

