ference. Critical-review considerations: the strata use measured baseline culture, growth, genomic instability, quality-control, and ploidy variables rather than outcome-derived leakage; cell counts are adequate; and the large four core effects are highly concordant across many independent strata. These conclusions remain dataset-specific associations, not causal mechanisms or externally generalizable predictions. No validation is requested because the independent validation budget is exhausted. From a multiplicity perspective, the four large associations would survive any reasonable multiplicity discipline; the smaller MDM2 evidence should continue to be interpreted as a broader locus-entangled predictor, not exact CDKN2A-only causality."
