 the high-copy/MTAP-wild-type context R286 all failed the minimum-cell-count requirement; they are closed unresolved because they cannot inform the association rather than because they show an effect. The lineage-subtype interaction R285 is -0.010 (0.088 to 0.068 in absolute terms; signed interval -0.088 to 0.068), very near zero and entirely within the practical 0.10-scale range; I reject the claimed adenocarcinoma-specific interaction and conclude that, within this dataset, the CDKN2A-loss/MDM2 association is not materially modified by lineage subtype at a meaningful scale. No validation was requested because the remaining new independent validation budget is zero."
